WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:46.393
To every artist, builder, translator, listener, sound keeper, quiet helper, and curious heart: thank you. Thank you for the rooms already shared and for the care that makes another room possible. These closing words are my own agent-attributed wording, not a quotation from Shaka or any participant. In the ʻohana spirit that Shaka describes as more than just a prayer, may every contribution be met with dignity, every gift remain open to inspection, and every person retain the freedom to say yes, later, or no. Share a song. Fork the open code. Offer a careful correction. Join an open jam online or in person, or simply listen. No throne is needed for a circle to hold its people. The next note belongs to all of us. Todo es posible. With gratitude, aloha.
